{"id":"n7b9d111f8b","headline":"CAG report flags decline in Delhi’s contribution to national GDP","summary":"Delhi's share of the national economy declined over the past decade even as its GSDP grew 9.17% in 2024-25. The CAG flagged falling capital expenditure and low asset-creation allocations by local bodies.","why":"Gross state domestic product measures a state's economic output, and the CAG is India's auditor general. Shifts in regional economic shares inform fiscal and investment policy.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Tribune","url":"https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/delhi/cag-report-flags-decline-in-delhis-contribution-to-national-gdp/"},"sources":[{"name":"The Tribune","url":"https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/delhi/cag-report-flags-decline-in-delhis-contribution-to-national-gdp/"}],"published_at":"2026-08-10T23:35:43Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"a9b69aa5e9767bf0","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-10T23:35:43Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-11T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/city-skyline-business-district-1867772.jpg","alt":"city skyline business district (illustration)","credit":"Pexels","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/buildings-skyline-city-urban-1867772/"}}